# Google Analytics 4 (brief 6). Set per environment so preview and local builds
# do not report into the live property. Leave it unset and no analytics load at
# all. NEXT_PUBLIC_ means it is inlined at build time, so changing it needs a
# redeploy. Consent gating is unaffected: GA never loads before the visitor
# accepts analytics cookies, whatever this is set to.
# Live value: G-TN54HGV0ME
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=
